      "note": "Total Governmental Funds lines (General government 48,477 + Street 30,677 + Cemetery 901 + Weston 150 8,172 + Capital outlay 612) sum to 88,839 but TOTAL DISBURSEMENTS prints 88,227; the Keno capital outlay 612 is also inside the total-column General government 48,477. Lines recorded as printed."
    },
