      "note": "Same 612 double count: with the printed Total Governmental Funds disbursement lines (88,839), 68,435 + 161,811 - 88,839 = 141,407, while the printed ending fund balance is 142,019 (it ties to the printed TOTAL DISBURSEMENTS 88,227). Keno capital outlay 612 is shown both inside General government 48,477 and as Capital outlay 612 in the total column."
